# Normalise line endings.
#
# Without this, a Windows editor (or OneDrive) rewrites files as CRLF and
# every tracked file shows up as modified even when the content is byte
# identical, which makes `git status` useless and hides real changes. Text
# files are stored LF in the repo and checked out LF, which is what the
# committed history already uses.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary, never touch these
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.avif binary
*.pdf binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
